   140	| T | ReAct | Memory | Stateful | SKILL.state |
   141	|---|---|---|---|---|
   142	| 50 | 0.978 ± 0.045 (0.936) | 0.809 ± 0.184 (0.953) | 0.991 ± 0.026 (0.996) | 0.999 ± 0.004 (1.000) |
