   310	
   311	Measured on Vertex with `gemini-3-flash-preview`, **within a single grid** (original
   312	environment, output cap 600, reasoning budget 0, n=5 episodes per cell) so that the
   313	comparison is not mixing conditions. The figure is cache-read tokens over total input
