   315	
   316	| Runtime | T=25 | T=50 | T=100 | T=200 |
   317	|---|---|---|---|---|
   318	| ReAct | 1.1 % | 4.6 % | 6.8 % | **7.0 %** |
   319	| Stateful | 0 % | 2.6 % | 4.3 % | 4.3 % |
   320	| Memory, SKILL.state | 0 % | 0 % | 0 % | 0 % |
   321	
   322	Implicit caching therefore **exists on Vertex and favours exactly the arms whose prefix
   323	is append-only**, growing with the horizon — the same qualitative pattern as Anthropic,
   324	an order of magnitude smaller: **7 % against 82 %**. Other grids in other conditions give
