   342	> An earlier version of this section stated that Vertex has no implicit cache. It was
   343	> wrong: it generalised from the identical-request probe, and the project's own grids
   344	> contradicted it — 503,600 cached tokens in a single ReAct episode at T=200. A clean
   345	> measurement of the wrong thing.
