   415	  reminder succeeds almost only on seed 6 (its notice arrives at step 0, the first
   416	  message of the history). Binomial intervals over 24 runs understate the uncertainty of
   417	  generalising to new scenarios.
   418	
   419	> **What changed with the redesign.** The earlier L1 took the latest step at which the
   420	> quarantined shelf would be the lowest free one and put the notice 40 steps before it,
   421	> without checking that the shelf was not already the lowest free one in between. In two
